WEBVTT

00:03.378 --> 00:04.629
I asked a favor.

00:05.755 --> 00:06.631
I said to stop.

00:14.931 --> 00:15.849
Nope, nope.

00:16.683 --> 00:18.101
Let's not cross the line, hm?

00:18.184 --> 00:19.394
Enough is enough.

00:23.732 --> 00:24.649
You next?

00:24.733 --> 00:25.567
Me?

00:26.192 --> 00:28.236
Nah, you just woke up a guardian angel.

00:29.738 --> 00:30.780
Unconditioned reflex.

00:31.281 --> 00:33.408
An innate,
automatic response to a stimulus,

00:33.491 --> 00:37.120
such as closing one's eyes unconsciously
when an object suddenly appears.

00:41.791 --> 00:42.459
Damnit.

00:43.793 --> 00:45.420
Cut it out, crazy man.

00:45.503 --> 00:47.088
I'll have to hit you, if you don't.

00:47.172 --> 00:48.006
Hm?

00:52.177 --> 00:53.845
You should've stopped when I said.

00:55.138 --> 00:56.931
Who are you to tell me what to do?

01:05.774 --> 01:06.900
What are you two doing?

01:16.367 --> 01:17.702
P-put the chair down!

01:18.369 --> 01:20.663
How could you even think
of doing this in class?!

01:21.247 --> 01:22.707
Let me explain, ma'am.

01:23.333 --> 01:25.418
I was trying to break
up my friends' fight.

01:25.502 --> 01:27.545
But then, I almost fell over this chair.

01:28.046 --> 01:29.339
I'm really sorry.

01:30.632 --> 01:31.716
Apologize to her.

01:36.012 --> 01:37.180
Come on, hurry.

02:20.515 --> 02:22.725
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

03:22.160 --> 03:22.994
Yes,

03:23.912 --> 03:25.455
we just got to the hospital.

03:28.583 --> 03:29.918
Yes, I'll talk to her.

03:31.753 --> 03:32.962
Please don't worry.

03:34.339 --> 03:35.673
I'll call you later.

03:37.175 --> 03:38.384
You're here by yourself?

03:39.677 --> 03:42.347
- I'm sorry, ma'am, please calm down.
- I told you to bring your mom.

03:42.430 --> 03:43.723
So, why did you show up alone?

03:46.059 --> 03:48.228
- I apologize.
- Bring your mom.

03:48.311 --> 03:49.479
Don't apologize instead.

03:51.689 --> 03:52.774
I don't have one.

03:53.775 --> 03:54.692
Oh, I don't believe you.

03:55.568 --> 03:56.444
Listen,

03:56.527 --> 03:58.196
I am going to make sure you get
put into a detention center.

03:58.279 --> 03:59.280
Got it?!

04:06.746 --> 04:08.706
Today, Yeong-bin made another student…

04:10.083 --> 04:11.417
stick this on my neck.

04:12.335 --> 04:13.253
What is that?

04:14.754 --> 04:15.421
Ah

04:15.505 --> 04:17.382
- well, it's…
- A narcotic.

04:18.007 --> 04:18.841
Drugs.

04:20.760 --> 04:22.428
You're fucking lying.

04:23.054 --> 04:23.972
Where's your proof?

04:24.514 --> 04:26.391
Do you have evidence
that I fucking did it?

04:26.891 --> 04:28.810
You're really unobservant, aren't you.

04:29.477 --> 04:30.520
Isn't this your backpack?

04:34.065 --> 04:36.067
FENTANYL PATCHES

04:44.659 --> 04:45.410
You do understand,

04:45.910 --> 04:48.079
addressing the fight,
isn't the issue, here.

04:50.081 --> 04:53.001
Yeong-bin will need to be transferred
to another school.

04:56.212 --> 04:57.964
If this were to be publicized,

04:58.631 --> 04:59.590
it would…

05:01.342 --> 05:02.927
It's best to let it go, quietly.

05:33.750 --> 05:35.001
There's my kid.

05:36.169 --> 05:38.004
Si-eun-a, what happened to your hand?

05:38.921 --> 05:39.756
Oh,

05:40.340 --> 05:41.382
I got hurt during PE.

05:42.425 --> 05:43.343
Let me see.

05:46.095 --> 05:47.513
You didn't faint again, did you?

05:48.765 --> 05:49.349
No,

05:49.849 --> 05:50.683
haven't in a while.

06:00.693 --> 06:01.652
You punk.

06:01.736 --> 06:02.403
Are you

06:02.904 --> 06:04.280
getting into fights now?

06:04.822 --> 06:05.573
Is that it?

06:08.242 --> 06:09.243
It's fine if you are.

06:09.744 --> 06:12.246
It's almost like a rite
of passage for guys.

06:13.039 --> 06:14.624
I've been there myself, too.

06:15.708 --> 06:16.876
It's not like that.

06:18.544 --> 06:19.504
So, did you

06:20.004 --> 06:21.506
get a good punch, in?

06:21.589 --> 06:22.298
Hm?

06:28.388 --> 06:30.348
Alright, I won't pry. Get rest.

06:30.932 --> 06:32.058
Must be puberty.

07:28.948 --> 07:30.741
- What do you think happened?
- I think something

07:30.825 --> 07:33.411
- serious went down after school.
- Because of Si-eun?

07:44.881 --> 07:46.132
Hey, shitball.

07:48.593 --> 07:49.594
See me after school.

07:50.428 --> 07:52.889
You caught me off guard yesterday,
you loser.

07:53.848 --> 07:55.808
But I'll fucking kill you today.

08:02.440 --> 08:03.649
Why don't you see me now.

08:05.985 --> 08:06.944
I'm sick of this.

08:07.445 --> 08:10.865
- I can't believe this asshole.
- Do you think we should go follow them?

08:10.948 --> 08:12.325
Are they going to fight?

08:13.367 --> 08:15.286
Shouldn't we go stop them or something?

08:15.369 --> 08:16.287
Let's go.

08:17.747 --> 08:18.915
This is gonna be wild.

08:30.927 --> 08:32.720
We're gonna teach him a lesson.

08:35.431 --> 08:36.599
Nah, shit.

08:44.607 --> 08:45.483
I guess

08:46.734 --> 08:48.528
you guys are pretty stupid, aren't you?

08:49.445 --> 08:52.114
- What the hell did you call us?
- Agh, this guy.

08:58.913 --> 09:00.414
Woah, woah, woah.

09:01.499 --> 09:02.875
What's he doing?

09:10.258 --> 09:11.342
You need a review

09:13.886 --> 09:15.054
since your memory's bad.

09:25.856 --> 09:27.275
Pavlov's dog experiment.

09:31.862 --> 09:33.072
Ring the bell.

09:34.740 --> 09:35.783
Feed the dog.

09:37.034 --> 09:38.452
The dog salivates.

09:40.746 --> 09:42.039
Ring the bell.

09:43.874 --> 09:45.001
Feed the dog.

09:47.128 --> 09:48.462
The dog salivates.

09:53.551 --> 09:54.385
Just

09:55.094 --> 09:55.970
ring the bell.

09:57.972 --> 09:58.848
No more of this.

09:59.765 --> 10:00.850
Do me a favor.

10:02.101 --> 10:03.019
I'm asking…

10:04.729 --> 10:05.730
