10:22.371 --> 10:23.914
- What's going on with them?
- They were just standing there

10:23.998 --> 10:25.333
- in the bathroom when we left.
- What happened?

10:25.416 --> 10:27.168
Hey, Si-eun, what happened in there?

10:27.251 --> 10:29.545
Did you show those assholes what's up,
again?

10:29.629 --> 10:32.673
Yeah, let's see what he says,
I wanna hear it from his mouth.

10:35.092 --> 10:36.385
He's gonna tell us what happened.

10:36.886 --> 10:37.803
Do I know you?

10:42.391 --> 10:43.309
Are we close?

10:52.276 --> 10:53.611
Dang, he is

10:53.694 --> 10:55.821
kinda badass though, not gonna lie.

11:28.854 --> 11:29.730
What's going on?

11:29.814 --> 11:30.815
Where is everybody?

12:05.516 --> 12:06.976
You didn't listen to what I said.

12:12.022 --> 12:12.690
What's this?

12:15.776 --> 12:17.445
Get a nose job, since you're here.

12:24.243 --> 12:25.369
Who is he?

12:26.912 --> 12:27.830
Guy in my class.

12:28.497 --> 12:29.832
How much will you pay?

12:31.083 --> 12:32.293
How much do you want?

12:33.711 --> 12:35.379
Are you made of fucking money?

12:37.339 --> 12:39.884
