12:52.396 --> 12:53.397
"Help me, hyung."

12:56.192 --> 12:57.151
Help me.

12:58.986 --> 12:59.820
Hyung.

13:21.258 --> 13:22.092
Hey,

13:22.301 --> 13:23.302
