13:48.160 --> 13:50.329
You can buy me a meal if
you want to apologize.

13:50.412 --> 13:52.122
Oh, the light. See ya around.

14:15.396 --> 14:17.773
These for me? Delivery.

14:19.650 --> 14:20.818
Hello, delivery.

14:35.416 --> 14:36.458
Delivery.

14:36.542 --> 14:37.918
Hey, do you want some candy?

14:38.002 --> 14:38.669
Yeah.

14:40.254 --> 14:41.463
Don't tell anyone, shh?

15:09.742 --> 15:12.077
BYUKSAN HIGH SCHOOL

15:13.829 --> 15:15.456
FACULTY SHOWER ROOM

16:12.846 --> 16:13.514
Hm?

16:14.014 --> 16:15.224
Time for lunch.

16:15.307 --> 16:16.350
Mhm.

16:17.851 --> 16:18.686
I'm good.

16:19.812 --> 16:20.938
