16:46.463 --> 16:47.506
Then don't eat it.

16:51.218 --> 16:52.261
I'll eat it.

16:58.559 --> 16:59.560
By the way,

17:01.395 --> 17:02.604
- why do you sleep here?
- Oh,

17:03.105 --> 17:04.898
I come here after my part-time job.

17:04.982 --> 17:07.109
