and my high school diploma.

17:15.117 --> 17:16.952
Are you music obsessed or something?

17:18.412 --> 17:19.621
You're always wearing earbuds.

17:20.122 --> 17:21.290
It's kinda rude, bro.

17:24.418 --> 17:25.294
Inconvenience.

17:25.377 --> 17:26.211
What?

17:27.087 --> 17:29.631
It's to prevent people from
trying to talk to me.

17:30.257 --> 17:32.051
You're a freakin' weirdo, you know that?

17:32.134 --> 17:33.886
Might want to look in the mirror.

17:42.686 --> 17:43.520
Ohh.

17:44.938 --> 17:45.606
Hey,

17:46.106 --> 17:47.441
why isn't Yeon Si-eun
getting reprimanded?

17:47.524 --> 17:48.984
I heard that

17:49.610 --> 17:51.987
Jeon Yeong-bin was caught
with fucking fentanyl.

17:52.071 --> 17:52.780
- Really?
- Ehh…

17:52.863 --> 17:54.156
- no way.
- It's legit.

17:54.239 --> 17:56.283
They're not punishing him,
so he doesn't talk.

17:56.366 --> 17:58.494
But why all of a sudden are
they hanging out together?

17:58.577 --> 17:59.495
I don't know.

17:59.578 --> 18:01.080
Out of nowhere they
became like best friends.

18:01.163 --> 18:02.998
I heard Ahn Su-ho is
freaking good at MMA.

18:03.082 --> 18:05.417
- He almost debuted in the AFC.
- I knew it.

18:05.501 --> 18:07.711
His counterpunch was fucking awesome.

18:07.795 --> 18:09.046
He's a good dancer too.

18:09.129 --> 18:11.465
PURCHASE GAME MONEY

18:24.061 --> 18:24.895
BET

18:37.241 --> 18:37.825
Stamp here,

18:38.325 --> 18:38.951
here,

18:39.451 --> 18:40.536
and here.

18:47.251 --> 18:48.418
Oh! Gucci.

18:49.586 --> 18:50.546
Nice bag.

18:51.088 --> 18:52.339
Where's the label?

18:57.136 --> 19:00.681
CREDITOR: JEON SEOK-DAE
DEBTOR: KIM WON-SEOK

19:03.767 --> 19:04.977
It's on. Awesome.

19:05.477 --> 19:06.311
When

19:07.187 --> 19:08.814
are you gonna wire the money?

19:11.775 --> 19:12.609
Go.

19:16.113 --> 19:20.159
That deal went so fucking
smooth, you know what I mean?

19:20.242 --> 19:21.118
Smooth.

19:23.662 --> 19:24.163
You're late.

19:24.663 --> 19:25.581
Yeah.

19:26.540 --> 19:27.583
I'm not sorry.

19:31.670 --> 19:34.173
- Why is everything so boring?
- Say hi to the kids.

19:34.256 --> 19:35.340
He's my cousin.

19:36.383 --> 19:37.259
He's rich.

19:39.678 --> 19:40.387
What?

19:42.222 --> 19:43.724
What do you want?

19:44.308 --> 19:45.517
You look like shit, dude.

19:46.393 --> 19:47.102
Who, me?

19:47.853 --> 19:49.021
- That's fuckin' rough.
- Man.

19:49.104 --> 19:49.688
Me?

19:50.189 --> 19:51.231
- Asshole.
- Fuckin' nice.

19:51.315 --> 19:52.191
