19:53.859 --> 19:54.693
Hey.

19:56.653 --> 19:58.030
When's he get out?

20:04.953 --> 20:05.829
Si-eun.

20:07.164 --> 20:08.040
Si-eun.

20:11.501 --> 20:13.045
You don't stay for night study?

20:13.545 --> 20:14.421
Hagwon?

20:15.964 --> 20:16.798
Yeah.

20:17.466 --> 20:18.884
Which hagwon do you go to?

20:20.344 --> 20:21.261
Daemyeong.

20:22.763 --> 20:24.765
I'm thinking about going to a hagwon too.

20:24.848 --> 20:25.849
