21:08.934 --> 21:10.477
Nobody woke me up.

21:10.560 --> 21:11.979
You said for us not to.

21:14.231 --> 21:15.065
I did?

21:16.483 --> 21:17.776
Can you wake me up in ten?

21:51.852 --> 21:52.936
This guy?

21:53.770 --> 21:54.855
This is bullshit.

21:55.355 --> 21:56.440
You're not embarrassed?

21:56.523 --> 21:57.566
