25:21.520 --> 25:22.145
Nice try.

25:24.314 --> 25:25.273
- Woah.
- Oh shit.

25:28.068 --> 25:30.278
- Agh, what the fuck.
- Agh.

25:30.820 --> 25:32.030
- Fuck.
- You fuck.

25:47.671 --> 25:48.380
