26:35.969 --> 26:37.053
Hey, get out of my way.

26:38.972 --> 26:39.973
You asshole!

26:40.140 --> 26:42.892
Fuck you bro. Fuck you. Shithead. Psycho.

26:42.976 --> 26:45.854
You staring fucking psycho! Fuck you, you

26:45.937 --> 26:47.981
Fuck, fuck, fuck, fucker!

26:49.733 --> 26:50.358
Hey,

26:50.859 --> 26:52.152
