38:02.321 --> 38:05.616
Next, why don't we talk about
indefinite equations.

38:05.700 --> 38:09.829
Indefinite equations are the very
core of all advanced mathematics.

38:10.329 --> 38:14.000
This concept is primarily used across
all of mathematics' areas,

38:14.083 --> 38:16.419
so we'll be going over it in detail today.

38:16.794 --> 38:18.379
Now, indefinite equations.

38:18.879 --> 38:21.299
What exactly do we call
an indefinite equation?

38:21.799 --> 38:24.010
"In" and "definite."

38:24.093 --> 38:26.721
These together mean an
undetermined equation.

38:27.221 --> 38:28.848
Why is it undetermined?

38:29.348 --> 38:32.685
Well, that's because there are
multiple possible answers,

38:32.768 --> 38:35.938
and it is difficult to point
to one of them and know,

38:36.022 --> 38:37.273
"This is the answer."

38:37.356 --> 38:40.568
So let's try to define this indefinite
equation mathematically.

38:40.651 --> 38:44.572
When we compare the number of unknowns
and the number of equations,

38:44.655 --> 38:48.242
the number of unknowns is greater
than the number of equations,

38:48.326 --> 38:49.952
which leads us to know that…

38:56.542 --> 38:57.752
Hey, fucker.

